{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13604","headline":"迎春东郊 · 王绰","name":"迎春东郊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉管潜移律，东郊始报春。\n銮舆应宝运，天仗出佳辰。\n睿泽光时辈，恩辉及物新。\n虬螭动旌斾，烟景入城闉。\n御柳初含色，龙池渐启津。\n谁怜在阴者，得与蛰虫伸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}